From ae084ae0350906da0be1ad4dc75d543b64c5f98a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iosvm-code <iosvm-code@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:43:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] stage23 A1: virtio-gpu discovery, controlq, GET_DISPLAY_INFO

Add drivers/gpu/hakios.virtio_gpu.c (device id 16, virtio-mmio slot scan, ACK/DRIVER/FEATURES_OK/DRIVER_OK, VIRTIO_F_VERSION_1 only, controlq 0 with desc/avail/used, one GET_DISPLAY_INFO request, parse display_info).  Wire it through drivers/gpu/conf, drivers/map, the input init hook and the stubs, with boot-arg virtio_gpu=1 (default off).  Add QEMU_VIRTIO_GPU=1 to qemu/run-darwin.sh, which adds -device virtio-gpu-device and cmdline virtio_gpu=1; default remains no GPU.  The driver object compiled as mach-o arm64 and exports _hakios_virtio_gpu_init.
---
 drivers/core/hakios.stubs.c           |   5 +
 drivers/gpu/conf                      |   5 +
 drivers/gpu/hakios.virtio_gpu.c       | 307 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/input/hakios.input.c          |   2 +
 drivers/map                           |   3 +
 qemu/run-darwin.sh                    |  23 +-
 xnu/files/bsd/sys/hakios.virtio_gpu.h |   9 +
 7 files changed, 352 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/hakios.virtio_gpu.c
 create mode 100644 xnu/files/bsd/sys/hakios.virtio_gpu.h

